From #3486, a hacky way to do this, using Mutex as an example:
```gdscript
class MutexLock extends RefCounted:
	var mutex: Mutex

	func _init(m: Mutex):
		mutex = m
		mutex.lock()

	func _notification(what):
		if what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:
			mutex.unlock()
```

